{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791399467800, "cell_id": "tw-6df7564eebfc", "run_id": "a99181c19b6f4e6aa027df05b1180d76", "seq": 12, "turn": 12, "text": "我試了在畫架與長椅兩道光交匯處，用線和紙卡編織出一個獨立且有邊界的區域。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_fortune", "ts_ms": 1791399467778, "cell_id": "tw-6df7564eebfc", "run_id": "a99181c19b6f4e6aa027df05b1180d76", "phase": "card", "attempt": 1, "mbti": "INTJ", "mbti_source": "ai", "zodiac": "摩羯", "element": "土", "blood": "A", "lines": ["它心裡一直想試的是：把「畫架與長椅」的兩道光交界處的土", "它試了：先去了畫架與長椅，再到長桌廣場，在長桌廣場做出《邊界空間》"]}
